We are dividing ourselves in oblivion with language. We are the SAME species. We don’t even look that different. We all look the same to aliens and other species on the planet. Our language(s) tells us that we’re all different. No. We are one single species that cannot agree on anything. The paradox of language is: it has both made us intelligent, and made us idiots. 

